  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Offre de services pour la r&#xE9;ponse aux Violences Bas&#xE9;es sur le Genre et Abus et Exploitation Sexuels, incluant l&#x2019;acc&#xE8;s aux services de sant&#xE9; reproductive (SR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide gender-based violence protection assistance and sexual and reproductive health assistance to refugees and returnees in Sila, Ouaddai and Wadi Fira. This UNFPA project establishes women- and girl-friendly safe spaces, provides psychosocial support and case management services, distributes dignity kits, and procures inter-agency reproductive health kits. This project provides humanitarian assistance to 40,000 people, including 16,400 women, 6,000 men, 17,600 children, and including 800 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
